Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `Stream` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/resource_in_body_close_copy.jet:15:8
    |
 15 |     b: a.copy()
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: A resource owns one cleanup duty; copying it would create two owners that could close the same handle
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`, or acquire a second resource
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211

Error [jet.CopyNotSupported]: `FileReader` can't be copied
  --> tests/ui/resource_in_body_close_copy.jet:18:8
    |
 18 |     s: r.copy()
    |        ^^^^^^
 Why: Copy needs a value made only of duplicable parts; this type holds something Jet can't duplicate — a function value, a trait value, or a type from outside Jet
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()` if this is its last use, or change the type so every part can be copied
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211
